subckt Chopper2Phase (VSS INP INN OUTP OUTN CLK1 CLK2)
subckt ideal_switch (p n cp cn)
parameters ron=1 roff=1e12 vt=0.5
core (p n) bsource i=v(p,n)/(v(cp,cn)>vt ? ron : roff)
ends ideal_switch
S1 (INP OUTP CLK1 VSS) ideal_switch
S2 (INN OUTN CLK1 VSS) ideal_switch
S3 (INP OUTN CLK2 VSS) ideal_switch
S4 (INN OUTP CLK2 VSS) ideal_switch
